1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
Registrations, payments, messages:

2
00:00:02,600 --> 00:00:07,000
code detects problems,
the agent investigates, volunteers decide.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Antoine has paid,
but still receives reminders.

4
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:17,000
The agent chooses its tools to match
his registration with the payments.

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,500
The match is still uncertain.

6
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:24,000
The agent suggests a match
and asks me to confirm.

7
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:27,000
I approve: the payment is linked.

8
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:31,000
The reply is placed
in a simulated outbox.

9
00:00:31,000 --> 00:00:36,000
A sponsor requests
the participants’ phone numbers.

10
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:39,500
The agent checks the rules
and forwards the request

11
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:43,000
to the organizers,
without sharing the data.

12
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:48,000
The same approach applies to
an orientation weekend for 100 students.

13
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
Their instructions become constraints:
budget, schedule and capacity.

14
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,500
Before searching, the agent asks whether
the €150 includes coach hire.

15
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:04,000
I confirm: everything is included.

16
00:01:04,000 --> 00:01:09,500
Using saved Jinko hotel offers,
three packages pass the checks.

17
00:01:09,500 --> 00:01:12,000
Rejections are explained.

18
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:16,000
F favors an earlier return; C costs less.

19
00:01:16,000 --> 00:01:21,000
The hotel’s ability to host the group
still needs confirmation.

20
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:26,000
What about €120 per person?

21
00:01:26,000 --> 00:01:28,000
No package fits.

22
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,000
The agent explains possible changes
without relaxing the constraints.

23
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:36,000
I restore the original budget.

24
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:41,000
I choose F. No booking is made.

25
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:47,000
This decision unlocks six tasks:
reminders, rooms and questions.

26
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Across 50 test messages,

27
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:55,000
the model selected the correct action type
in 45 cases.

28
00:01:55,000 --> 00:01:58,000
Bureau Agent. You decide.
